{"text":"kuruntokai","n":186,"lines":["ஆர்கலி யேற்றொடு கார்தலை மணந்த","கொல்லைப் புனத்த முல்லை மென்கொடி","எயிறென முகையும் நாடற்குத்","துயிறுறந் தனவால் தோழியென் கண்ணே"],"tr":["ārkali yēṟṟoṭu kārtalai maṇanta","kollaip puṉatta mullai meṉkoṭi","eyiṟeṉa mukaiyum nāṭaṟkut","tuyiṟuṟan taṉavāl tōḻiyeṉ kaṇṇē"],"colophon":{"tinai":"mullai","tinai_ta":"முல்லை","speaker_ta":"தலைவி கூற்று","poet_ta":"ஒக்கூர் மாசாத்தியார்","speaker_en":"the heroine (talaivi)","poet_tr":"Okkūr Mācāttiyār"},"scan":{"meter":"nēricai āciriyappā","ok":true,"checks":[{"name":"lines","ok":true,"detail":"4 lines"},{"name":"feet per line","ok":true,"detail":"3×4, 1×3 feet"},{"name":"foot types","ok":true,"detail":"iyaṟcīr 14, veṇcīr 1"},{"name":"linkage","ok":true,"detail":"āciriyattaḷai 9, veṇṭaḷai 4, kalittaḷai 1"},{"name":"ending","ok":true,"detail":"ends on ஏ"}],"ending":"ஏ","lines":[[{"text":"ஆர்கலி","tr":"ārkali","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"ஆர்","tr":"ār"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"கலி","tr":"kali"}]},{"text":"யேற்றொடு","tr":"yēṟṟoṭu","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"யேற்","tr":"yēṟ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"றொடு","tr":"ṟoṭu"}]},{"text":"கார்தலை","tr":"kārtalai","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கார்","tr":"kār"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"தலை","tr":"talai"}]},{"text":"மணந்த","tr":"maṇanta","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"மணந்","tr":"maṇan"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"த","tr":"ta"}]}],[{"text":"கொல்லைப்","tr":"kollaip","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கொல்","tr":"kol"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"லைப்","tr":"laip"}]},{"text":"புனத்த","tr":"puṉatta","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"புனத்","tr":"puṉat"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"த","tr":"ta"}]},{"text":"முல்லை","tr":"mullai","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"முல்","tr":"mul"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"லை","tr":"lai"}]},{"text":"மென்கொடி","tr":"meṉkoṭi","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"மென்","tr":"meṉ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"கொடி","tr":"koṭi"}]}],[{"text":"எயிறென","tr":"eyiṟeṉa","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"எயி","tr":"eyi"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"றென","tr":"ṟeṉa"}]},{"text":"முகையும்","tr":"mukaiyum","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"முகை","tr":"mukai"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"யும்","tr":"yum"}]},{"text":"நாடற்குத்","tr":"nāṭaṟkut","foot":"tēmāṅkāy","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"நா","tr":"nā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"டற்","tr":"ṭaṟ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"குத்","tr":"kut"}]}],[{"text":"துயிறுறந்","tr":"tuyiṟuṟan","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"துயி","tr":"tuyi"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"றுறந்","tr":"ṟuṟan"}]},{"text":"தனவால்","tr":"taṉavāl","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"தன","tr":"taṉa"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வால்","tr":"vāl"}]},{"text":"தோழியென்","tr":"tōḻiyeṉ","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தோ","tr":"tō"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"ழியென்","tr":"ḻiyeṉ"}]},{"text":"கண்ணே","tr":"kaṇṇē","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கண்","tr":"kaṇ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ணே","tr":"ṇē"}]}]]},"ai":{"lines":[{"words":[{"surface":"ஆர்கலி","parts":[{"text":"ஆர்கலி","lemma":"ārkali","gloss":"roaring sound"}],"gloss":"roaring sound of thunder"},{"surface":"ஏற்றொடு","parts":[{"text":"ஏற்றொடு","lemma":"ஏற்றொடு","gloss":"with thunder"}],"gloss":"with thunder","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"கார்","parts":[{"text":"கார்","lemma":"kār","gloss":"rainy season"}],"gloss":"rainy season"},{"surface":"தலை","parts":[{"text":"தலை","lemma":"talai","gloss":"beginning"}],"gloss":"beginning"},{"surface":"மணந்த","parts":[{"text":"மணந்த","lemma":"மணந்த","gloss":"which has united"}],"gloss":"which has united","split_unverified":true}]},{"words":[{"surface":"கொல்லை","parts":[{"text":"கொல்லை","lemma":"kollai","gloss":"dry land clearing"}],"gloss":"dry land clearing"},{"surface":"புனத்த","parts":[{"text":"புனத்த","lemma":"புனத்த","gloss":"of the field"}],"gloss":"of the field","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"முல்லை","parts":[{"text":"முல்லை","lemma":"mullai","gloss":"jasmine"}],"gloss":"jasmine"},{"surface":"மென்","parts":[{"text":"மென்","lemma":"மென்","gloss":"soft"}],"gloss":"soft","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"கொடி","parts":[{"text":"கொடி","lemma":"koṭi","gloss":"creeper"}],"gloss":"creeper"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"எயிறு","parts":[{"text":"எயிறு","lemma":"eyiṟu","gloss":"teeth"}],"gloss":"teeth"},{"surface":"என","parts":[{"text":"என","lemma":"ena","gloss":"like"}],"gloss":"like"},{"surface":"முகையும்","parts":[{"text":"முகை","lemma":"mukai","gloss":"bud"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"um","gloss":"adjectival suffix"}],"gloss":"budding"},{"surface":"நாடற்கு","parts":[{"text":"நாடு","lemma":"nāṭu","gloss":"land"},{"text":"அற்கு","lemma":"aṟku","gloss":"dative suffix"}],"gloss":"to the lord of the land"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"துயிறுறந்","parts":[{"text":"துயிறுறந்","lemma":"துயிறுறந்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"தனவால்","parts":[{"text":"தனவால்","lemma":"தனவால்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"தோழியென்","parts":[{"text":"தோழியென்","lemma":"தோழியென்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"கண்ணே","parts":[{"text":"கண்ணே","lemma":"கண்ணே","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true}],"as_printed":true}],"literal":"Roaring thunder-with rainy-season-beginning united / dry-land field-of jasmine soft creeper / teeth like budding land-lord-to / sleep abandoned indeed, O friend, my eyes!","translation":"The beginning of the rainy season has arrived, united with roaring thunder. In the forest clearings, the soft jasmine creepers are budding like white teeth. For the lord of this land, my eyes have completely abandoned sleep, O friend!","modern":"ஒலிக்கும் இடியுடன் கார்காலம் தொடங்கிவிட்டது. முல்லை நிலத்துக் கொல்லைப் புனத்தில் உள்ள மென்மையான முல்லைக் கொடிகள் பற்களைப் போல அரும்புகளைத் தோற்றுவிக்கின்றன. அத்தகைய நாட்டின் தலைவனுக்காக, தோழியே! என் கண்கள் உறக்கத்தை இழந்துவிட்டன.","explanation":"The heroine is speaking to her close friend in the mullai (forest) landscape, which is traditionally associated with patient waiting. The rainy season, which the hero promised to return by, has arrived, marked by roaring thunder. The jasmine creepers in the forest clearings are budding, and their white buds resemble beautiful teeth. Seeing these signs of the season, the heroine is filled with longing and anxiety because her lover has not yet returned. Consequently, her eyes have completely lost their sleep, and she shares her grief with her friend.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"}}